OL,3,GNEWSAFive injured in M6 van and car
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive people have been injured in a
OL,7,Fcrash involving a van and a car that
OL,8,Fresulted in the closure of a motorway
OL,9,Fin both directions, causing severe
OL,10,Fdelays.
OL,12,FCheshire Police said the collision
OL,13,Fhappened at about 03:30 GMT on the
OL,14,Fnorthbound M6 at junction 20 near
OL,15,FWarrington, where it meets the M56 at
OL,16,FLymm Interchange.
OL,18,FA North West Ambulance Service
OL,19,Fspokesperson said five people had been
OL,20,Ftaken to hospital, two of whom with
OL,21,Fserious injuries.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
